  "description": "High-performance pure C# .NET 10 Multimodal LLM, Generative Video & Image (Flow-Matching DiT + 3D VAE), Kokoro Voice TTS, Whisper STT, and Vision CLI application (glacier). Features interactive chat REPL, side-by-side comparative benchmarking against Ollama GPU, model inspection, APNG/GIF/AVI video generation, and Ollama/OpenAI-compatible HTTP serving. Zero Python, zero C++ runtime dependencies.",
